  Slug: seer-of-the-dead
  DisplayName: Seer of the Dead
  IconPath: systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/background.svg
  Description: You have long been gifted with the ability to see and speak with the
    departed. This could have manifested at your birth or when a chance encounter
    linked you inextricably to the spirits of the dead. Their constant presence might
    feel like a curse, or it might provide you with welcome companionship. You gain
    one ability boost. It must be to Constitution or Wisdom . You're trained in Religion
    and Undead Lore. You gain the effects of the @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Spirit
    Sense] spell at all times.
